    "body": "Nested color parsing is kinda thorny. I think this is *partially* due to our current usage of `ansi_term`, which is eventually [going to be replaced with owo-colors](https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/3770), but even once that's done, we might need to make some changes to the color parsers to get this to work correctly.",
